tasks.description:
创建 Note 数据库模型用于存储笔记。在 app/models/ 目录下创建 note.py 文件，包含字段: id (int, 主键), title (str, 笔记标题), content (str, 笔记内容), created_at (datetime, 创建时间), updated_at (datetime, 更新时间)。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- GET /notes -> [{id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

创建笔记的 CRUD API 路由。在 app/routes/ 目录下创建 notes.py 文件，包含以下功能: 创建笔记 (POST /notes), 获取所有笔记 (GET /notes), 获取单个笔记 (GET /notes/{id}), 更新笔记 (PUT /notes/{id}), 删除笔记 (DELETE /notes/{id})。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- GET /notes -> [{id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

创建笔记管理的前端页面。在 templates/ 目录下创建 notes.html 文件，包含以下功能: 显示所有笔记的列表 (通过 GET /notes 获取数据), 提供创建新笔记的表单 (通过 POST /notes 提交数据), 提供编辑和删除笔记的按钮 (分别调用 PUT /notes/{id} 和 DELETE /notes/{id})。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- GET /notes -> [{id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

在后端实现搜索功能，支持通过标题或内容关键字搜索笔记。在 app/routes/notes.py 中添加 GET /notes/search 路由，接收 query 参数 (如 ?q=keyword)，返回匹配的笔记列表。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- GET /notes -> [{id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}
- GET /notes/search (request: {q: str}) -> [{id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}]

在前端页面中添加搜索框，支持通过关键字搜索笔记。在 templates/notes.html 中实现搜索功能，调用 GET /notes/search 接口，动态更新笔记列表。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- GET /notes -> [{id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}
- GET /notes/search (request: {q: str}) -> [{id: int, title: str, content: str, created_at: str, updated_at: str}]
